* Alternative sizing: shorter, wider input pair (L = 0.8 um, W = 120 um), narrower and
* shorter load mirror (W = 80 um, L = 0.8 um), and a 3.3:1 tail mirror at L = 2 um.
.subckt ota_5t vss ibias vdd vinn vinp vout
XINP nm vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.8 w=120 nf=15
XINN vout vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.8 w=120 nf=15
XLD nm nm vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.8 w=80 nf=16
XLO vout nm vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.8 w=80 nf=16
XTAIL tail ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=300 nf=30
XBIAS ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=90 nf=9
.ends ota_5t
